  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"1141\">\n<li data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"855\">\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"770\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"709\">PDGFR-&alpha; (Platelet-Derived Growth Factor Receptor Alpha)</strong> gene fusion (commonly <strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"749\">FIP1L1-PDGFRA</strong>) is associated with:</span></p>\n<ul data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"855\">\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"811\">\n<p data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"811\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"775\" data-end=\"811\">Hypereosinophilic Syndrome (HES)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"855\">\n<p data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"855\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"855\">Chronic Eosinophilic Leukemia (CEL)</strong></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"967\">\n<p data-start=\"858\" data-end=\"967\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Detection of this mutation confirms <strong data-start=\"894\" data-end=\"917\">clonal eosinophilia</strong> and has <strong data-start=\"926\" data-end=\"966\">prognostic and therapeutic relevance</strong>.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1071\">\n<p data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1071\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\">Patients with this mutation often respond <strong data-start=\"1012\" data-end=\"1040\">dramatically to imatinib</strong> (a tyrosine kinase inhibitor).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 9px;\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1141\">\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1141\"><span style=\"font-size: 9px;\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1093\">Negative result</strong> does not rule out other causes of eosinophilia.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
